      "post_id": "86337",
      "author_handle": "Amelia88",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 10 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "Some people say they don't find drinking the glucose drink too bad. For me, I thought it was pretty awful! Just syrupy, sweet, thick, and it was just a lot in one go!\nI thankfully got normal results - I've heard of people having to go back and drink even more of it to do a 3 hour glucose test rather than the 1 hour test.\nWhat did you think of the glucose test? Were your results normal? If they were outside the normal range, what kind of monitoring did you need?",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9958/#86337",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/96d4081dfe1af398e82a.html",
